From f4773bad29baeeddcffb556a11f5bd20914a167a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaeliGlow <caeliglow@mockifylab.local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:13:03 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] caeliglow: dock right-edge panels with concave corners and
 wire spring motion

Panels can opt into screen-edge docking (dockToScreenEdge); the power
pill docks to the right edge with the same concave flare treatment as
the bottom-docked launcher. Open/close animations consume the
[caeliglow] motion settings, including the squash-and-stretch pulse for
fizzy/morphy.
